    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Table of Nations"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This is the account of Shem, Ham and Japheth, Noah’s sons, who themselves had sons after the flood."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Japhethites"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Japheth:",
          "Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshek and Tiras."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Gomer:",
          "Ashkenaz, Riphath and Togarmah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Javan:",
          "Elishah, Tarshish, the Kittites and the Rodanites."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "(From these the maritime peoples spread out into their territories by their clans within their nations, each with its own language.)"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Hamites"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Ham:",
          "Cush, Egypt, Put and Canaan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Cush:",
          "Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah and Sabteka.",
          "The sons of Raamah:",
          "Sheba and Dedan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cush was the father of Nimrod, who became a mighty warrior on the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He was a mighty hunter before the Lord; that is why it is said, “Like Nimrod, a mighty hunter before the Lord.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The first centers of his kingdom were Babylon, Uruk, Akkad and Kalneh, in Shinar."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "From that land he went to Assyria, where he built Nineveh, Rehoboth Ir, Calah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and Resen, which is between Nineveh and Calah—which is the great city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Egypt was the father of",
          "the Ludites, Anamites, Lehabites, Naphtuhites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pathrusites, Kasluhites (from whom the Philistines came) and Caphtorites."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Canaan was the father of",
          "Sidon his firstborn, and of the Hittites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jebusites, Amorites, Girgashites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hivites, Arkites, Sinites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Arvadites, Zemarites and Hamathites.",
          "Later the Canaanite clans scattered"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and the borders of Canaan reached from Sidon toward Gerar as far as Gaza, and then toward Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah and Zeboyim, as far as Lasha."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These are the sons of Ham by their clans and languages, in their territories and nations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Semites"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sons were also born to Shem, whose older brother was Japheth; Shem was the ancestor of all the sons of Eber."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Shem:",
          "Elam, Ashur, Arphaxad, Lud and Aram."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Aram:",
          "Uz, Hul, Gether and Meshek."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Arphaxad was the father of Shelah,",
          "and Shelah the father of Eber."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Two sons were born to Eber:",
          "One was named Peleg, because in his time the earth was divided; his brother was named Joktan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Joktan was the father of",
          "Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Obal, Abimael, Sheba,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ophir, Havilah and Jobab. All these were sons of Joktan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The region where they lived stretched from Mesha toward Sephar, in the eastern hill country."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These are the sons of Shem by their clans and languages, in their territories and nations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These are the clans of Noah’s sons, according to their lines of descent, within their nations. From these the nations spread out over the earth after the flood."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
